{"server":"tw","storyId":"act3d0_level_act3d0_05_beg","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_05","title":"別阻止我","storyCode":"OF-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"6e1588d7483bc14be2aea52e66a03996a0202d6304fcca0bc6241d6eb05b1ed2","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sunnytown_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有人有沒有都熱火朝天地嗨起來？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為了迎接黑曜石節最盛大的晚會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"從今天的12點起，各大商場、遊樂設施，以及部分餐廳、酒吧都將舉行限時的預熱活動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"千萬不要錯過這些最盛大的宴會！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Festival_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"你果然會來這裡，小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"黑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定會來這裡。在被克洛寧拒絕以後，你想用廣播塔散佈資訊，讓全城人聽到你的報告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"這行不通，小姐，這只會帶來更大的混亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"也許你討厭你的父親，也討厭這個城市，但老爺已經付出得夠多了。黑曜石節和這個城市會因此分崩離析。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道我的報告會引起軒然大波，也會引發許多後果，但大家都有權知道真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道老爺的過錯。老爺為了這座城市做了很多不好的事情，只是沒有這些事，根本不會有汐斯塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"這次完全不一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"如果小姐覺得不能解氣的話，批評我就可以了，請不要做出些沒法挽救的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你是不是覺得我還在耍小孩子脾氣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"不，小姐。我可以和你一起慢慢說服老爺，我保證。只是現在，請跟我回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"黑......別這麼說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"我理解你和老爺之間有許多不快，但你應該先回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼說話！我知道你想讓我和爸爸之間的關係緩和一些，但你能不能不要是現在這個樣子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼就不能像以前一樣呢，就像以前一樣，像朋友一樣和我說話啊，黑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是道爾科斯家的僕人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想你這麼說，黑。我不要聽你這麼說！怎麼會變成這樣的，你為什麼會變成這個樣子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"你還猶豫些什麼？快把她抓起來啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"——她是道爾科斯家的女兒。別太僭越。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"但市長已經要你全力協助克洛寧先生了！你要看著她散佈謠言，毀掉整個汐斯塔嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"......用用你的腦子。她一個人在這裡，沒有表現出哪怕一丁點的焦躁，甚至......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得她真的想進入廣播塔嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，你在把自己當成誘餌吸引我，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"......你還是瞭解我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"我不敢這麼說，小姐。只不過你沒有否認我的猜測，我可以下結論了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"現在這個時候，羅德島應該已經出現在市政廳了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什麼？這可不在我們的計畫裡啊！市政廳那邊現在是什麼情況？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得，那群酒囊飯袋，現在大概正被打得四處亂竄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧的保鏢","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"外面怎麼沒聲音了？不是讓他們趕緊把材料搬走，這麼急的事情怎麼還能偷懶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧的保鏢","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？剛才那陣叫駡，難道又有人打架了？不管了，趕緊把手上的處理——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先生，請開門！我們是來送快遞的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧的保鏢","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯？你們沒人要收什麼東西吧？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧的保鏢","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"（都沒有？奇怪......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧的保鏢","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"你送錯地方了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是先生，這個快遞就是寫著送到這裡的啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧的保鏢","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"走開！再纏著我們，小心棍棒不長眼睛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧的保鏢","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，臭小鬼，肯定又是來騙錢的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎不管了！博士，站旁邊些，我來把這東西踹開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？沒關係的！這點力氣我還是有的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧的保鏢","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧的保鏢","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊啊？！大門怎麼倒了，我的天，你是什麼——"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"漂亮的一腳！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"朋友，可不能粗魯對待快遞員啊。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，我早就想這麼試試了。接下來我要試試這句話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，咳咳，哼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"“開門！快遞！”"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這不是已經被你踢開了嗎！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_290_vigna","aliases":["紅豆"]},{"speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","aliases":["黑"]},{"speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","aliases":["錫蘭"]}]}
